G('nsaid', 'NSAID', ['NSAID', 'NSAIDs'], 'Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug', 'A painkiller that also reduces inflammation by blocking COX enzymes, for example ibuprofen, naproxen, diclofenac.', 'basics', ['screening', 'docking', 'adme'])
G('coxib', 'Coxib', ['coxib', 'coxibs'], 'COX-2 selective inhibitor', 'A drug designed to block COX-2 more than COX-1, for example celecoxib, rofecoxib, etoricoxib.', 'basics', ['screening', 'docking'])
