G('inhibitor', 'Inhibitor', [], '', 'A compound that reduces the activity of an enzyme or other target.', 'basics', ['screening', 'docking'])
G('haem', 'Haem (heme)', [], '', 'An iron-containing helper molecule built into some proteins, including COX-2. It is a cofactor, not part of the protein chain.', 'basics', ['docking'])
