G('angstrom', 'Å', ['Å'], 'Ångström', 'A unit of length: 0.1 nanometre (10⁻¹⁰ m). A typical chemical bond is 1 to 1.5 Å long.', 'structure', ['all'])
G('bfactor', 'B-factor', [], 'Temperature factor', 'A number stored for each atom in a crystal structure that tells how much the atom seems to move or be uncertain. Large values mean floppy or poorly defined regions.', 'structure', ['md'])
G('protonation', 'Protonation state', [], '', 'Whether a group on a molecule carries an extra hydrogen (and charge) at a given pH. Histidine in particular can change, which changes the hydrogen bonds it can make.', 'structure', ['docking', 'project'])
