G('nvt', 'NVT / NPT', ['NVT', 'NPT'], 'Constant volume or pressure ensembles', 'NVT keeps the number of particles, volume and temperature fixed. NPT keeps the pressure, not the volume, fixed. They are the two equilibration stages before production.', 'md', ['md', 'project'])
